The checklist collection includes adaptations from TitanApps blog articles
and original contributions and replacement versions supplied by the repository
owner. Historical source titles and URLs and contribution details are retained
in catalog.json; SOURCES.md lists the articles. Formatting guidance is based on
the linked Smart Checklist Cloud documentation, supplemented by original
repository conventions and examples.

